<title>USA: Campbell board approves 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Campbell board approves 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>CAMDEN, N.J. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Campbell Soup Co said Wednesday its board had approved a two-for-one stock split, payable to stockholders of record February 24.</p>
<p>Campbell stock was last split on December 2, 1991, on a two-for-one basis.</p>
<p>&quot;Our decision to split the stock comes at a time of strong investor confidence in Campbell's performance and reaffirms our commitment to building shareowner wealth,&quot; said David Johnson, Campbell chairman, president and chief executive officer.</p>
</text>
